  "worked_solution": "The universal quantifier \"$\u2200$\" means \"for all.\" So, our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $x\\in R,{x}^{2}\\in {R}^{+}.$\n\nThis can be further simplified as follows:\n\n$\\,$ The square of any real number is positive.\n\n**Note:** This statement is false.",
